Reported in https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pull/18137.\r\n\r\nWhen a REST Client interface is defined as:\r\n\r\n```\r\n    @RegisterRestClient(configKey = \"simple\")\r\n    public interface SimpleClient {\r\n        @Path(\"\")\r\n        @GET\r\n        TraceData noPath();\r\n    }\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhen the OpenTelemetry client filter is setting the span name, it results in the following exception:\r\n```\r\nCaused by: java.lang.StringIndexOutOfBoundsException: String index out of range: -1\r\nat java.base/java.lang.String.substring(String.java:1841)\r\nat io.quarkus.opentelemetry.tracing.client.ClientTracingFilter.filter(ClientTracingFilter.java:41)\r\nat org.jboss.resteasy.client.jaxrs.internal.ClientInvocation.filterRequest(ClientInvocation.java:686)\r\n... 118 more\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior\r\nNo exception and a reasonable client span name is set\r\n\r\n### Actual behavior\r\nAn exception is thrown, preventing the trace from being recorded properly","closed_by":{"login":"kenfinnigan","id":441240,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MTI0MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/441240?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenfinnigan","html_url":"https://github.com/kenfinnigan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenfinnigan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenfinnigan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenfinnigan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenfinnigan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenfinnigan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenfinnigan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenfinnigan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenfinnigan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenfinnigan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github